    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, so when I look at the world around us right now as a father of seven children and as a business owner and as a farmer, I've just grown up with that Southern Minnesota Norwegian teaching of whatever you're doing, leave it better than you found it. And I just feel like I can't sit back and watch what's happening. I just don't feel like our country is in a better place than I was gifted by my parents and grandparents and great-grandparents. So I feel called to step up and serve. All",
