      {
        "text": "Urea and other fertilizer prices have increased by 200% to 400%.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "People generally do not pay attention to how food is prepared or its origins.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Despite rising market prices, farmer profitability is being eroded due to increased production costs.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Providing food to the country and the world involves significant challenges.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Farmers in southern Minnesota are environmentally innovative and technologically advanced.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The achievements of southern Minnesota farmers are rarely recognized by policymakers in Washington.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
